Silo

A user-friendly Chrome extension to modify game elements in Farm Merge Valley on Discord.
Silo connects to the active Discord tab, attaches the Chrome debugger,
and captures the in-game services after the first object movement.
Once initialized, you can trigger resource injections directly from the extension popup.

Installation:
* Download the project and extract the archive
* Open Chrome and navigate to chrome://extensions/
* Enable Developer Mode (top-right toggle)
* Click "Load unpacked" and select the extracted project folder

Usage:
* Open Farm Merge Valley on Discord
* Click Initialize in the extension popup
* Select a resource, set the amount, and click Inject

Troubleshooting:
* Debugger detaches        : reload the Discord tab and click Initialize again
* No active tab found      : make sure Farm Merge Valley is open before initializing
* Resources not injected   : verify the resource name and amount are valid
